sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Change and cancel lessons
    %% Stories: 20, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 38, 39, 40, 41, 55, 56, 57
    %% Description: Trainers edit and cancel their own lessons, admins any lesson or training session. Customers are notified of a cancellation and confirm that they are aware of it.
    actor TP as Trainer (person)
    actor AD as Admin
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant LE as Lesson
    participant TS as TrainingSession
    participant BK as Booking
    participant CU as Customer

    %% covers 33, 34, 35, 36, 37
    TP->>LE: edit own lesson
    %% covers 38
    AD->>LE: edit any lesson
    %% covers 20
    AD->>TS: edit any training session
    %% covers 39
    TP->>LE: cancel lesson
    %% covers 40
    AD->>LE: cancel lesson
    LE->>BK: canceled bookings
    %% covers 41, 55
    BK->>CU: notify of cancellation
    %% covers 56
    CP->>CU: confirm awareness of the cancellation
    CU->>BK: confirmation
    %% covers 57
    AD->>BK: see who has confirmed
